   "css": "",
   "html": "<div class=\"wrapper frontpage\"> <h2 class=\"assessment_heading\">Assess <span> your Back Health</span></h2> <p>Hey there! This health assessment tool is designed by our experts. We will guide you through a series of movements and ask you to report your observations. These movements are carefully curated to assess various key aspects of your musculoskeletal health. Some of them will need to be performed lying on the ground or sitting on a chair/stool. For certain movements, you will need to record the time, and the timer on your mobile device can be helpful for this. <br> Based on your responses, this assessment tool will generate your health score on a scale of 1 to 10. When taken periodically, this health score will help you monitor your health progress. So, find a quiet corner, and let’s get started.</p> </div>"
  },
  {
   "id": 149,
   "type": "html",
   "page": 1,
   "label": "",
   "description": "",
   "required": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "css": "consent_text",
   "html": "Please note that your information shared here is completely safe and is used only for arriving at the assessment results. The assessment results are indicative and do not substitute medical expert consultation in any way. Appropriate user discretion is advised. You may refer to our <a href=\"/terms-of-services/\">Terms of Service</a> for further clarity."
  },
