   "css": "right_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"right_col\"> <h3>How <span>to test?</span></h3> <p>Start on all fours and extend one arm forward and the opposite leg back while keeping your back flat. Repeat on other side. </p> <img src=\"https://betterhood.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bird-dog-duration.webp\"> </div>"
