   "css": "dyk_html",
   "html": "<div class=\"dyk_wrapper\"> <div class=\"heading\"> <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/did_you_know_light_icon.svg\"> <h3>Did <span>You Know?</span></h3> </div> <p>The slump test is a valuable tool for assessing back mobility as it evaluates the flexibility of the spine and the nervous system under tension, helping identify potential issues. </p> </div>"
