   "html": "<div class=\"right_col\"> <h3>How <span>to test?</span></h3> <p>Lie on your back with knees bent. Drop your knees to one side, keeping your shoulders down, then switch sides. Note any pain or tightness in your back or legs. </p> <img src=\"https://betterhood.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Lying-leg-drop.webp\"> </div>"
